        }
      ],
      "en": "“The bows of the mighty men are broken. Those who stumbled are armed with strength.",
      "ko": "용사의 활은 꺾이고 넘어진 자는 힘으로 띠를 띠도다",
      "source_text_hash": "7a9d85fd794c4dd5474e225f5f720641baac80eccff37bcbd7bfd82e623d6a88",
      "translation_text_hash": "4d28173e47619df8af750904399cf0a3931cf6ae34dcb949e486f9e72a9cec42",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "용사의 활은 꺾이고 넘어진 자는 힘으로 띠를 띠도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "4d28173e47619df8af750904399cf0a3931cf6ae34dcb949e486f9e72a9cec42"
      ]
