      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1SA",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "Now the sons of Eli were wicked men. They didn’t know the LORD.",
      "ko": "엘리의 아들들은 불량자라 여호와를 알지 아니하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "582f1095ed460649c7176bb4f2860e05d63971b14531e0da0ee64f15e03c96b9",
      "translation_text_hash": "305d1e3b827f2047b015cc80997b1b330ab60951c934a4e8e5ef87a9804feebb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
